WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.964 --> 00:00:02.103
Welcome to Autistik.

2
00:00:02.103 --> 00:00:06.487
In this video you will launch your very own coin on BNB Chain, step by step.

3
00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:07.682
No coding is needed.

4
00:00:07.682 --> 00:00:12.578
Everything on screen uses demo data and a demo wallet, so nothing here is real money.

5
00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:16.450
But the screens are the same ones you will use on autistik dot I O.

6
00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:18.580
First, connect your wallet.

7
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.073
Tap Connect Wallet at the top right, then choose your wallet app.

8
00:00:22.073 --> 00:00:25.302
Or use the Autistik wallet with your email, Google or Apple.

9
00:00:25.302 --> 00:00:29.272
Your keys stay with you, and Autistik will never ask for your seed phrase.

10
00:00:29.903 --> 00:00:33.102
Before you launch, you need two things in the same wallet.

11
00:00:33.102 --> 00:00:36.301
About twenty dollars of the Autistik token, on BNB Chain.

12
00:00:36.301 --> 00:00:40.107
And some BNB, which goes into your coin's trading pool as liquidity.

13
00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:41.541
Launching itself is free.

14
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:46.119
A small launch contribution of about three dollars is taken out of your liquidity.

15
00:00:46.783 --> 00:00:48.290
Now, how do you add funds?

16
00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.609
Open the Wallet menu and tap My wallet.

17
00:00:50.609 --> 00:00:51.768
Then press Receive.

18
00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:54.145
You will see your address and a QR code.

19
00:00:54.145 --> 00:00:56.058
The steps are shown right there.

20
00:00:56.058 --> 00:00:58.202
Buy BNB on an exchange like Binance.

21
00:00:58.202 --> 00:01:03.304
Withdraw it to your address, and pick the network called BNB Smart Chain, B E P twenty.

22
00:01:03.304 --> 00:01:05.158
It shows up in a minute or two.

23
00:01:05.846 --> 00:01:08.327
To get the Autistik token, use the Swap page.

24
00:01:08.327 --> 00:01:10.091
Pay with BNB, and get Autistik.

25
00:01:10.091 --> 00:01:11.911
We cover that in our Swap video.

26
00:01:11.911 --> 00:01:15.715
Once your funds arrive, your balance shows at the top of the wallet.

27
00:01:16.339 --> 00:01:17.249
Now let's launch.

28
00:01:17.249 --> 00:01:19.712
Open the Launch menu, and tap Launch a token.

29
00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:25.870
You have two ways to launch: a Quick launch form, or Launch with Autistik, where the assistant asks you questions.

30
00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.369
We will use the quick form.

31
00:01:27.369 --> 00:01:28.761
It is free and unlimited.

32
00:01:29.357 --> 00:01:32.541
There is a second way to launch, with the Autistik assistant.

33
00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:33.898
Tap Launch with Autistik.

34
00:01:33.898 --> 00:01:35.203
You get two chats a day.

35
00:01:35.203 --> 00:01:39.378
It asks one question at a time, by text or by voice with the microphone button.

36
00:01:39.378 --> 00:01:44.024
Pick the chain, then answer with the name, the ticker, the liquidity and how to lock it.

37
00:01:44.024 --> 00:01:47.051
It builds the same launch plan for you to check and sign.

38
00:01:47.051 --> 00:01:48.930
It never asks for your seed phrase.

39
00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.018
If you prefer a form, use Quick launch.

40
00:01:54.435 --> 00:01:55.637
Type your token name.

41
00:01:55.637 --> 00:01:57.355
We will call ours Calm Otter.

42
00:01:57.355 --> 00:02:00.790
Then the ticker, which is the short symbol people will see.

43
00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.107
We will use O T T E R.

44
00:02:02.756 --> 00:02:05.807
Total supply is one billion by default, and it is fixed.

45
00:02:05.807 --> 00:02:07.005
Nobody can mint more.

46
00:02:07.005 --> 00:02:09.838
Your free share is the part of the supply you keep.

47
00:02:09.838 --> 00:02:12.399
Five percent is fine, and the limit is twenty.

48
00:02:12.399 --> 00:02:14.415
The rest goes into the trading pool.

49
00:02:15.035 --> 00:02:15.984
Next, liquidity.

50
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:20.193
This is how much BNB goes into the pool so people can trade your coin.

51
00:02:20.193 --> 00:02:21.261
Any amount works.

52
00:02:21.261 --> 00:02:23.455
A bigger pool means steadier prices.

53
00:02:23.455 --> 00:02:25.411
We will use zero point five BNB.

54
00:02:26.018 --> 00:02:28.117
Now the most important choice for trust.

55
00:02:28.117 --> 00:02:31.894
Tax is optional, ten percent at most, and it can only be lowered later.

56
00:02:31.894 --> 00:02:37.350
Under Liquidity, you can burn it forever, or lock it in the Autistik Locker for six months or one year.

57
00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:40.603
Either way, nobody, not even you, can pull the liquidity out.

58
00:02:40.603 --> 00:02:42.177
Buyers look for exactly that.

59
00:02:42.177 --> 00:02:43.069
We will burn it.

60
00:02:43.695 --> 00:02:44.984
Press Review launch plan.

61
00:02:44.984 --> 00:02:48.749
Autistik shows your whole plan in plain words, before you sign anything.

62
00:02:48.749 --> 00:02:57.464
The supply, what you keep, what goes into the pool, how the liquidity is handled, that there is no tax, and a zero point three percent trade fee that supports Autistik.

63
00:02:58.087 --> 00:02:59.049
Read the warning.

64
00:02:59.049 --> 00:03:03.068
Token prices can go to zero, so only use money you can afford to lose.

65
00:03:03.068 --> 00:03:06.181
Tick the box to say you understand, then press Launch.

66
00:03:06.181 --> 00:03:08.332
Your wallet asks you to confirm once.

67
00:03:08.332 --> 00:03:09.916
That is the only signature.

68
00:03:10.519 --> 00:03:11.532
Your coin is live!

69
00:03:11.532 --> 00:03:16.990
Autistik shows its contract address, a link to the chart on DexScreener, and a link to trade it.

70
00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:18.397
Now press Start trading.

71
00:03:18.397 --> 00:03:21.323
Until you do, only wallets you whitelisted can buy.

72
00:03:21.323 --> 00:03:24.080
It also opens by itself after twenty four hours.

73
00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:29.651
For the first five minutes, each buy is limited to one percent of the supply, to stop sniper bots.

74
00:03:30.254 --> 00:03:31.419
Here is the good part.

75
00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:34.649
Your coin is added to the Autistik Launch Pad automatically.

76
00:03:34.649 --> 00:03:39.837
Open your token page to see its price, liquidity and chart, and a way to promote it so it trends.

77
00:03:39.837 --> 00:03:45.503
It also appears on the Trending page, under New on the Launch Pad, where everyone on Autistik can find it.

78
00:03:46.157 --> 00:03:52.215
It also shows up inside every member's wallet, in a list called New on Autistik, so they can buy it in a few taps.

79
00:03:52.772 --> 00:03:54.681
Say a friend wants to buy your coin.

80
00:03:54.681 --> 00:03:56.538
They open their wallet and tap it.

81
00:03:56.538 --> 00:04:00.834
Autistik runs a safety check and shows a plain warning when a coin is brand new.

82
00:04:00.834 --> 00:04:03.751
They pick an amount, tick the risk box, and press Buy.

83
00:04:03.751 --> 00:04:05.448
Then it appears under My coins.

84
00:04:09.404 --> 00:04:10.808
They can also use our Swap.

85
00:04:10.808 --> 00:04:16.893
They paste your contract address into the token search, and Autistik finds your coin on the right network by itself.

86
00:04:16.893 --> 00:04:18.713
Then they type an amount and swap.

87
00:04:18.713 --> 00:04:21.105
The best price is found across the exchanges.

88
00:04:25.519 --> 00:04:26.084
That is it.

89
00:04:26.084 --> 00:04:30.191
You launched a coin, and anyone can find it, scan it, and trade it on Autistik.

90
00:04:30.191 --> 00:04:35.223
Share your contract address, never promise profits, and never share your seed phrase with anyone.

91
00:04:35.223 --> 00:04:37.790
And if you get stuck, tap Ask the bot at the top.

92
00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.871
Thanks for watching, and welcome to the Autistik community.

